WCAG 2.2 and Techniques for WCAG 2.2 (W3C Group Notes); and WAI-ARIA 1.2,
W3C Recommendation. Success criterion text, notes and glossary definitions in
wcag22-a11y/references/ are quoted verbatim with a link to each section.
  Copyright © 2024 World Wide Web Consortium.
  https://www.w3.org/copyright/document-license-2023/
  WCAG 2.2: https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/
