  of the Go standard library, rendered by pkgsite. The Go documentation and
  pkgsite are Copyright The Go Authors, BSD-3-Clause.
  https://go.dev/LICENSE
- iso999/evals/baselines/api-audits/rust/{std,chrono,time,jiff}-all.html:
  rustdoc "All items" pages. Rust standard library documentation: MIT or
  Apache-2.0 (The Rust Project Developers). chrono: MIT or Apache-2.0.
  time: MIT or Apache-2.0. jiff: MIT or Unlicense.
