Standards that are NOT included
-------------------------------
ISO 999:1996 is copyright ISO and is licensed per user. ASD-STE100 is
copyright ASD. The iso999 and ste100 folders are tool-only editions: they
contain no text, paraphrase, or data from either specification. Rule IDs cite
clause and rule numbers only. The ste100 dictionary is built by each user
from their own download of the specification into a local .cache/ folder,
which is excluded from version control.
